From 1982468255f11db29a46cc00ef876ae6c1e7bc48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexandre Rosenfeld <arsfeld@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:16:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix(watch-sync): reconcile once per item across all its
 server copies

With several copies mapped, reconciling each copy on its own let an
unwatched copy pull an unwatch over a watched one. Changes now group by
local item and fold through Reconciler.merge_remotes/1, and a push goes
to every mapped copy. A push failing on any copy records no snapshot,
so the next run retries.
---
 lib/mydia/watch_sync/engine.ex        | 84 +++++++++++++++++----------
 test/mydia/watch_sync/engine_test.exs | 63 +++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 114 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

